name: Perkeo — negative consumables
author: corpus
description: >-
  Perkeo creates a Negative copy of a random consumable in your possession at the end of
  each shop. First-shop legendary from The Soul: carry powerful consumables (The Soul,
  Cryptid, Black Hole, The Emperor) and duplicate them.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      arcanaPacks: [0, 1]
      spectralPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - spectralCard: Cryptid
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - spectralCard: BlackHole
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - tarotCard: TheEmperor
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Cartomancer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
